{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Projects\">Projects</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PurchaseOrders\">Purchase Orders</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is On Orders Project PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders\">The <strong>Project Purchase Orders</strong> screen displays all purchase orders associated with a specific project.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And By Invoice Invoiced Is On Project Purchases Status Three To ToDate\">This screen helps you monitor the financial status of purchases for your project by tracking three key amounts: what has been ordered, what has been invoiced, and what remains to be invoiced.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"View\">Overview</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Contains Is Item On Project PurchaseOrder Sent To ToDate\">Each row represents a purchase order that contains items or services allocated to this project.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Is On Port Project PurchaseOrder To ToDate Total\">The amounts shown reflect only the portion of each purchase order that relates to this specific project, not the total purchase order value.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column On\">Column Information</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And Date Is On OrderNumber PurchaseOrder Sent Supplier\">The table displays essential information about each purchase order including the date, purchase order number, supplier details, and financial amounts.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And Column Invoice Invoiced On Uninvoiced\">The <strong>Uninvoiced</strong> column highlights amounts that have been ordered but not yet invoiced, helping you track outstanding commitments.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Date PurchaseOrder\">The date when the purchase order was created.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PurchaseOrder\">Purchase Order</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"PurchaseOrder\">Purchase Order</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On OrderNumber PurchaseOrder Reference\">The <em>purchase order number</em>, which may include a reference if one was entered.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Edit OrderNumber PurchaseOrder To ToDate View\">Click the purchase order number to view or edit the full purchase order details.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Supplier\">Supplier</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is PurchaseOrder Supplier\">The <em>supplier</em> associated with this purchase order.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Is Name On Supplier\">If a <em>supplier code</em> has been assigned, it will be displayed alongside the supplier name.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Project\">Project</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Project\">Project</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount OrderAmount Project PurchaseOrder To ToDate\">The <em>project</em> to which these purchase order amounts are allocated.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Is Orders Project PurchaseOrder PurchaseOrders View\">This column shows the same project for all rows since you are viewing purchase orders for a specific project.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"OrderAmount\">Order Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"OrderAmount\">Order Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Is Item On Project PurchaseOrder To ToDate Total\">The total value of items and services on this purchase order that are allocated to the project.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Invoice Invoices Is Less Project Received Sent\">This represents the committed purchase amount for the project, regardless of whether invoices have been received.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InvoiceAmount\">Invoice Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InvoiceAmount\">Invoice Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Invoice Invoiced Is Project PurchaseOrder\">The amount that has already been invoiced against this purchase order for the project.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Invoice Invoices Is Project PurchaseInvoice PurchaseInvoices PurchaseOrder Sent To ToDate\">This represents <em>purchase invoices</em> that have been entered referencing this purchase order and allocating costs to the project.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Uninvoiced\">Uninvoiced</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Uninvoiced\">Uninvoiced</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Invoice Invoiced On PurchaseOrder Remaining\">The remaining amount on the purchase order that has not yet been invoiced.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And Invoice Invoiced Is OrderAmount\">This is calculated as the <em>order amount</em> minus the <em>invoiced amount</em>, helping you track outstanding purchase commitments.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice Invoiced Is Project PurchaseOrder\">A zero value indicates the purchase order has been fully invoiced for this project.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "project-purchase-orders"
}
